    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with zero money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl whose parents have disappeared and whose remaining assets are depleted, earns her living by &quot;working&quot; in a game that mines cryptocurrency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By collecting coins and materials to upgrade PCs and in-game items, she aims for the lower layers that offer better rewards. When she finally reaches &quot;that place,&quot; the truth awaits her... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Byte Survivor is a roguelike action game where you can select from various weapons and items for automated attacks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and level up!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/9095a54c5bc460671c05b92de26dff70.poster.avif?t=1749420562\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/9095a54c5bc460671c05b92de26dff70.webm?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/9095a54c5bc460671c05b92de26dff70.mp4?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Weapon Slot and upgrade Mod Item !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/536cd0c6f3059b17ade33bd5658d5124.poster.avif?t=1749420562\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/536cd0c6f3059b17ade33bd5658d5124.webm?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/536cd0c6f3059b17ade33bd5658d5124.mp4?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your PC !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/60872b451e796a3d9874b44c4e397139.poster.avif?t=1749420562\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/60872b451e796a3d9874b44c4e397139.webm?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/60872b451e796a3d9874b44c4e397139.mp4?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Gems at mining points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/e8f9ef86458ff82bb87b394adedcbc58.poster.avif?t=1749420562\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/e8f9ef86458ff82bb87b394adedcbc58.webm?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/e8f9ef86458ff82bb87b394adedcbc58.mp4?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Light to expand your range of action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/dd735af4c8adbb6fb9b9b9bcfa586a12.poster.avif?t=1749420562\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/dd735af4c8adbb6fb9b9b9bcfa586a12.webm?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950490/extras/dd735af4c8adbb6fb9b9b9bcfa586a12.mp4?t=1749420562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your stats using collected coins and Gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages with multiple difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple selectable characters.</p>",
